        "full_section_text": "CD annotations‘Q’added pencil, circled pencil‘Q’added pencil, circled pencil‘Q’added pencil, circled pencil Top of first page: ‘On Rarity of intermediate forms.’pencil; ‘Dec. 28 1856. (8th letter)’ pencil End of last page: ‘12’pencil",
        "dated_note_literal": "Dec. 28 1856. (8th letter)",
